This extension packages modified Google MCP Toolbox for Databases v1.3.0,
commit b0010060a939455d91e4f8ba62dc3e72b1892469.
Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0 (included in LICENSE).
Source: https://github.com/googleapis/mcp-toolbox

The Toolbox source patch adds static parameters preserving numeric types,
explicit bounded transactions without managed retries, safe large integer
serialization and controlled network policy. Only Neo4j source and static
Cypher tool packages are registered.

The included Neo4j Go driver v6.0.0 is modified with a policy dial hook and
bounded Bolt messages. Driver source: https://github.com/neo4j/neo4j-go-driver
Copyright Neo4j Sweden AB; Apache-2.0. Both source patches, build pins and
native provenance accompany the extension.

